{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shadow\u2019s End - Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <strong>Akaria</strong> and experience the <strong>core mechanics</strong> of <i>Shadow\u2019s End</i> in this <strong>exclusive demo</strong>! Build your party, test different character builds, and engage in <strong>real-time tactical battles</strong> against powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hire &amp; Equip</strong> \u2013 Recruit warriors, mages, and archers, then customize them with weapons and armor.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Use positioning, skills, and strategy to overcome diverse enemy encounters.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>XP &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Level up your team and experiment with different party compositions.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>RTS-RPG Hybrid Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Control your squad in fast-paced battles while managing resources and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo focuses on <strong>combat, character growth, and team-building</strong>, offering a glimpse into the <strong>full adventure</strong> coming soon. Your <strong>feedback is invaluable</strong>, so share your thoughts and help shape the game\u2019s future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist the full game and join our community!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589450?t=1744721444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589450?t=1744721444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589450/a88e51bf874bcec592e6863743efa3ae5117ff9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744721444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589450/a88e51bf874bcec592e6863743efa3ae5117ff9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744721444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description"